{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >687 Days on Mars invites you to try the free demo!</h2><br>Step onto the Red Planet and test your survival skills in the harshest environment known to humankind. Manage every breath, every drop of water, and every spark of energy as you fight to endure Mars itself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you in the demo:</h2>\ud83d\udd34 About an hour of gameplay<br>\ud83d\udd34 Story introduction<br>\ud83d\udd34 10 buildings to build<br>\ud83d\udd34 Oxygen and energy production<br>\ud83d\udd34 Water extraction<br>\ud83d\udd34 Searching for a supply drop<br>\ud83d\udd34 Sandstorm<br>\ud83d\udd34 Growing 3 vegetables<br>\ud83d\udd34 Meal preparation<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you survive the first steps on Mars... or will the planet claim you in the demo?</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/8c18f078ab69dcf78410258c34e343d4.avif?t=1759409416\" width=600 height=174 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/6edbf1a0ea8aef1111328822845e7f61.avif?t=1759409416\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Alone on Mars, you awaken with nothing but your suit and a handful of supplies. Every breath, every drop of water, and every spark of energy must be carefully managed as you fight to survive on a planet that wants you gone - you navigate the harsh realities of life on the Red Planet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/c6bcaddd9c476cd30944a77f237f4bfc.poster.avif?t=1759409416\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/c6bcaddd9c476cd30944a77f237f4bfc.webm?t=1759409416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/c6bcaddd9c476cd30944a77f237f4bfc.mp4?t=1759409416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/b53db1de360c254d0b6adf353766e6b9.avif?t=1759409416\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Start small and dream big. Expand your outpost with life-support systems, storage units, and advanced research modules. Every upgrade increases your odds of long-term survival, letting you transform a fragile shelter into a thriving Martian base.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/b3169fc95738abc4099df4b84c4f7f15.poster.avif?t=1759409416\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/b3169fc95738abc4099df4b84c4f7f15.webm?t=1759409416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/b3169fc95738abc4099df4b84c4f7f15.mp4?t=1759409416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/522fad500c3bf5b556c351453d9699e2.avif?t=1759409416\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Unlock the secrets of Mars through dedicated research. Develop new technologies to improve your equipment, optimize resource management, and adapt to the planet\u2019s unique challenges. Every breakthrough brings you one step closer to surviving in this environment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/01e0aa85af456674760d84096f8b46b2.poster.avif?t=1759409416\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/01e0aa85af456674760d84096f8b46b2.webm?t=1759409416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/01e0aa85af456674760d84096f8b46b2.mp4?t=1759409416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/45a5ea90a409ef233daec5d2cc338092.avif?t=1759409416\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Construct makeshift greenhouses to grow your own food and produce vital oxygen. Using advanced aeroponic and hydroponic methods, you can cultivate plants without soil, overcoming the challenges of Mars. Experiment with different techniques to survive and adapt to the environment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/051b00301728277a306135ac4c434fa7.poster.avif?t=1759409416\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/051b00301728277a306135ac4c434fa7.webm?t=1759409416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/051b00301728277a306135ac4c434fa7.mp4?t=1759409416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/01433565468542078cecbaa2656b9ba2.avif?t=1759409416\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Leave the safety of your base to explore the vast Martian landscape. Search for previously sent supply drops and unexpected discoveries that could change your fate. Every expedition brings new risks and rewards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/42ac0497ee6d5451933fd9e95bc51e8b.poster.avif?t=1759409416\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/42ac0497ee6d5451933fd9e95bc51e8b.webm?t=1759409416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/42ac0497ee6d5451933fd9e95bc51e8b.mp4?t=1759409416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/extras/41bb719cb912007394b1213bf4f494c2.webp?t=1759409416\" width=600 height=60 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3850990?t=1759409416","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3850990?t=1759409416","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/f8fe387d72204da4cb0d2943d670a14075b94130/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759409416","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850990/f8fe387d72204da4cb0d2943d670a14075b94130/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759409416","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >687 Days on Mars invites you to try the free demo!</h2><br>Step onto the Red Planet and test your survival skills in the harshest environment known to humankind. Manage every breath, every drop of water, and every spark of energy as you fight to endure Mars itself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you in the demo:</h2>\ud83d\udd34 About an hour of gameplay<br>\ud83d\udd34 Story introduction<br>\ud83d\udd34 10 buildings to build<br>\ud83